WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
From around 20 degrees Celsius, dairy cows begin to experience heat stress.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
What matters is not just temperature, but humidity as well.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The temperature-humidity index, THI, combines both into a single number.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Shade, air movement and plenty of fresh water help the animals.
